 api+=panel('A small request, a useful response','<pre><code>fetch("/api/stats")\n  .then(response =&gt; {\n    if (!response.ok) throw new Error("Pool unavailable");\n    return response.json();\n  })\n  .then(pool =&gt; console.log(pool.hashrate));</code></pre><div class="two-grid"><div><h3>Units & windows</h3><p>Hashrate is hashes/second. Account balances and payments use Shannon (10⁹ units per RGN). Block reward strings use wei (10¹⁸ per RGN). Timestamps are Unix seconds, except stats.now in milliseconds. Recent lists are bounded by the mining API.</p></div><div><h3>Freshness & errors</h3><p>Poll no faster than once every 15 seconds. X-Data-As-Of is the gateway retrieval time; X-Data-Stale marks cached fallback data. Health.updated and stats.now provide source timestamps. Expect 404 for unknown accounts and 503 when live data is unavailable.</p></div></div>')
